BoomMine AttackWave R1
    Events
        Unit - A unit enters BoomMineR1 <gen>
    Conditions
        (Remaining time for BoomMineTimerR1) Equal to 0.00
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Owner of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Player 1 (Red)
                (Owner of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Player 2 (Blue)
    Actions
        -------- ============== --------
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        -------- ============== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in BoomMineGroupR1) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                -------- EVENT --------
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Center of BoomMineR2 <gen>)
                Set VariableSet VarPoint2 = (Center of BoomBrothersMineIn <gen>)
                For each (Integer A) from 1 to 5, do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Unit - Create 1 Goblin Miner (Level 10) for Player 12 (Brown) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                        Unit - Order (Last created unit) to Attack-Move To VarPoint2
                        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to BoomMineGroupR1
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint2)
                -------- Timer to start --------
                Countdown Timer - Start BoomMineTimerR1 as a One-shot timer that will expire in 240.00 seconds
                -------- ============== --------
                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
            Else - Actions
                -------- If group has still units --------
                Set VariableSet VarPoint2 = (Center of BoomBrothersMineIn <gen>)
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in BoomMineGroupR1 and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Unit - Order (Last created unit) to Attack-Move To VarPoint2
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint2)
                -------- ============== --------
                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
